Jr. indirect <1% of Cove Kaz Capital (Kazakh tungsten)", "cluster": "trumpbiz", "clusterLabel": "Trump family business & crypto", "entityKind": "person"}, {"@id": "node/lara-trump", "@type": ["pm:Actor", "schema:Person"], "name": "Lara Trump", "description": "Fox News weekend host", "cluster": "trumpbiz", "clusterLabel": "Trump family business & crypto", "entityKind": "person"}, {"@id": "node/witkoff-sons-zach-alex", "@type": ["pm:Actor", "pm:Group"], "name": "Witkoff sons (Zach, Alex)", "description": "WLF co-founders (Zach = CEO)", "cluster": "trumpbiz", "clusterLabel": "Trump family business & crypto", "entityKind": "group"}, {"@id": "node/world-liberty-financial", "@type": ["pm:Actor", "schema:Organization"], "name": "World Liberty Financial", "description": "Trump-family crypto / USD1; 49% sold to Tahnoon-backed Aryam; Alt5 $1.5B WLFI deal (Aug 2025); OCC preliminary trust charter (Aug 14 2026); sued Oct 22 2026 (Greenberg derivative emoluments suit, D.D.C.)", "cluster": "trumpbiz", "clusterLabel": "Trump family business & crypto", "entityKind": "organization"}, {"@id": "node/american-bitcoin-hut-8", "@type": ["pm:Actor", "schema:Organization"], "name": "American Bitcoin (Hut 8)", "description": "Nasdaq: ABTC (Hut 8 ~80%)", "cluster": "trumpbiz", "clusterLabel": "Trump family business & crypto", "entityKind": "organization"}, {"@id": "node/1789-capital-polymarket-kalshi", "@type": ["pm:Actor", "pm:Group"], "name": "1789 Capital / Polymarket / Kalshi", "description": "Don Jr. fund (1789) + prediction markets; Don Jr. Polymarket adviser; Kalshi adviser role ended Nov 12 2026", "cluster": "trumpbiz", "clusterLabel": "Trump family business & crypto", "entityKind": "group"}, {"@id": "node/trump-media", "@type": ["pm:Actor", "schema:Organization"], "name": "Trump Media", "description": "DJT: bitcoin treasury (PIPE incl. ~$100M DRW, May 2025); Crypto.com $50M stock (Aug 2025); TAE merger pending", "cluster": "trumpbiz", "clusterLabel": "Trump family business & crypto"