e at Milne Point; ~$380K/quarter DC lobbying", "cluster": "russia", "clusterLabel": "Russia ties (Kremlin, oligarch, Lukoil)", "entityKind": "organization"}, {"@id": "node/nvidia", "@type": ["pm:Actor", "schema:Organization"], "name": "Nvidia", "description": "AI chipmaker; Huang reinstated as President, CEO and director Nov 22 2026 (8-K); Kress remains EVP/CFO after serving as interim CEO; Chair Harvey C. Jones; new National Security and Export Control Committee of independent directors and a CCO search; CA AG Bonta investigative subpoena Nov 19 (no response or 8-K through Nov 23); GC Teter Form 4 filed Nov 23 (30,000 sh sold Nov 19 under a May 22 2026 10b5-1 plan); SEC probe still reported only; $10.0B of Anthropic Class N (placement closed Nov 20); Trump SAID Nov 24 a US equity stake is 'probably not too late' (NY Post; not raised; no filing); S&P put its AA ratings on CreditWatch negative Nov 25 2026 (M&G modifier to neutral; 90-day review); Bloomberg (Nov 27): Blackwell GB300 rack at an Alice Huang-linked Shanghai site; Nvidia did not respond", "cluster": "media", "clusterLabel": "Media owners & platforms", "entityKind": "organization"}, {"@id": "node/amd", "@type": ["pm:Actor", "schema:Organization"], "name": "AMD", "description": "AI chipmaker (CEO Lisa Su); Helios racks at Meta; $1B into Meta's Oct 2026 equity offering", "cluster": "media", "clusterLabel": "Media owners & platforms", "entityKind": "organization"}, {"@id": "node/george-kollitides", "@type": ["pm:Actor", "schema:Person"], "name": "George Kollitides", "description": "Pentagon: Feinberg co-chief of staff; director Economic Defense Unit + BOND; vice-chair OSC investment committee; ex-Remington CEO; ex-A&M Capital partner (SEC filing: 'Senior Advisor')", "cluster": "defense", "clusterLabel": "Defense & Intel", "entityKind": "person"}, {"@id": "node/alvarez-marsal-a-m-capital-a-m-federal", "@type": ["pm:Actor", "schema:Organization"], "name": "Alvarez & Marsal (A&M Capital / A&M Federal)", "descrip