om Gulf investors for a fund that buys companies and runs them with AI/robotics (Roze unit); early-stage UAE talks including people near MGX/G42; Saudi PIF sounded out; no commitment and no closed deal. Outreach/talks only — not ownership, not a signed raise. Related map edges (stargate-oracle-mgx, openai-g42-stargate-uae, son-trump-100b-pledge) stay separate. Register: grokbot-2026-10-12-I-dariocpx-2109813340285603976-softbank-100bn-gulf-bailout.", "citation": ["https://www.ft.com/content/3bc0eaa5-a8d4-47e8-903c-7dd762d947dd", "https://www.japantimes.co.jp/business/2026/10/09/companies/softbank-ai-gulf-investors/", "https://thegulfmagazine.com/softbank-asks-gulf-investors-for-up-to-100-billion-for-a-new-ai-fund"]}, {"@id": "tie/phang-v-blanche-efta-litigation", "@type": "pm:Tie", "from": "node/phang-efta-plaintiff", "to": "node/todd-blanche", "name": "Phang v Blanche suit", "tieType": "legal action (plaintiff v. AG / DOJ under Epstein Files Transparency Act)", "category": "business", "kind": "register", "date": "2026-04-27 - pending", "grade": "V", "saidDone": "DONE", "sequenceOnly": false, "status": "pending", "statusDate": "2026-11-13", "statusNote": "ECF 64 (Nov 9 2026): DOJ ordered to publish redacted handwritten FBI notes behind three FD-302s in the Epstein Library within 14 days (by Nov 23) + compliance notice within 24h; temporarily stayed if DOJ first moves the DC Circuit for a stay. No compliance notice or stay motion checked at build.", "addedIn": "2026-10-12 (v10)", "lastChecked": "2026-11-13", "registerRow": "grokbot-2026-10-12-powermap-v10-V-phang-v-blanche-efta-litigation", "newInVersion": false, "sourceTier": "primary", "singleSource": false, "nSourceDomains": 3, "description": "DONE procedural: Phang v. Blanche filed Apr 27 2026, D.D.C. 1:26-cv-01417 (Judge Emmet G. Sullivan), plaintiff vs AG/DOJ defendants over Epstein Files Transparency Act compliance (CourtListener / PlainSite). Oct 2026 docket still active: DOJ Oct 1 motions to postpone admin re