r Thiel to meet 2017", "tieType": "named for Thiel to meet (email)", "category": "contact", "kind": "register", "date": "2017-05-24", "grade": "V", "sequenceOnly": false, "status": "active", "addedIn": "2026-10-09 (v2)", "lastChecked": "2026-10-09", "registerRow": "grokbot-2026-10-08-V-powermap-epstein-thiel-action-trail-2014-2017", "newInVersion": false, "sourceTier": "press", "singleSource": false, "nSourceDomains": 7, "description": "2017-05-24 Thiel asked 'who should I meet in ME?'; Epstein routed him to MBS among others. SEQUENCE ONLY vs Thiel-MBS meeting Apr 2018; no source shows Epstein arranged it.", "citation": ["https://www.epsteinscan.org/document/424632", "https://epstein-data.com/EFTA01045377", "https://www.epsteinscan.org/document/697481", "https://epsteinexposed.com/documents/efta-efta01914006", "https://www.dropsitenews.com/p/modi-epstein-files-bannon-billionaire-anil-ambani-india-israel-united-states-justice-department", "https://www.thenationalnews.com/business/technology/saudi-arabia-s-crown-prince-wraps-up-whirlwind-tour-of-silicon-valley-1.719351", "https://www.businessinsider.com/tim-cook-peter-thiel-rupert-murdoch-met-with-bin-salman-2020-1", "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2018-04-06/google-thiel-stand-out-in-saudi-prince-s-silicon-valley-tour"]}, {"@id": "tie/epstein-routes-thiel-dubai-qatar-2017", "@type": "pm:Tie", "from": "node/jeffrey-epstein", "to": "node/dubai-qatar-rulers", "name": "named for Thiel to meet 2017", "tieType": "named for Thiel to meet (email)", "category": "contact", "kind": "register", "date": "2017-05-24", "grade": "V", "sequenceOnly": false, "status": "active", "addedIn": "2026-10-09 (v2)", "lastChecked": "2026-10-09", "registerRow": "grokbot-2026-10-08-V-powermap-epstein-thiel-action-trail-2014-2017", "newInVersion": false, "sourceTier": "primary", "singleSource": false, "nSourceDomains": 7, "description": "Same 2017-05-24 exchange: Epstein routed Thiel to Sheikh Mohammed and Sultan bin Sulayem (Dubai) and H